,"称":{"c":"称","pinyin":"chēng","lectures":["chēng","chèn","chèng"],"niveau":2,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["禾","⺈","小"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L2-0062","L2-0381","L3-0088","L4-0086","L5-0101","L5-0102","L7-0444","L7-0445","L7-0962","L7-1599","L7-1995","L7-2354","L7-3660","L7-4703","L7-5552"],"chemin":{"hsk":228,"lire":238},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"appeler, nommer ; peser","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"appeler, nommer"},{"categorie":"V","fr":"peser"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"大家都称他老王。","pinyin":"Dàjiā dōu chēng tā Lǎo Wáng.","fr":"Tout le monde l'appelle Lao Wang.","statut":"relu"},{"zh":"你称一下这些水果。","pinyin":"Nǐ chēng yīxià zhèxiē shuǐguǒ.","fr":"Pèse ces fruits, s'il te plaît.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":{"statut":"relu","etiquette":"atteste","fr":"Le Shuowen jiezi écrit 稱 et le glose « peser » : le grain, 禾, et 爯 pour le son. Peser le grain, c'est évaluer ; nommer une chose, c'est la juger à sa valeur. Simplifié, 爯 devient 尔, écrit ⺈ sur 小, qui ne donne plus le son de chēng.","en":"The Shuowen jiezi writes 稱 and glosses it as “to weigh”: grain, 禾, and 爯 for the sound. Weighing grain is assessing it; naming a thing is judging its worth. Simplified, 爯 becomes 尔, written ⺈ over 小, which no longer gives the sound of chēng.","roles":{"禾":"sens","⺈":"forme","小":"forme"}}},"乘":{"c":"乘","pinyin":"chéng","lectures":["chéng","shèng"],"niveau":5,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["禾","匕","匕"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L5-0109","L5-0110","L5-0111","L5-0112","L7-0463","L7-0674","L7-2382"],"chemin":{"hsk":626,"lire":619},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"prendre (un transport) ; multiplier","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"prendre, monter dans (un transport)"},{"categorie":"V","fr":"multiplier"},{"categorie":"V","fr":"profiter de (l'occasion)"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"三乘五等于十五。","pinyin":"Sān chéng wǔ děngyú shíwǔ.","fr":"Trois fois cinq font quinze.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"呈":{"c":"呈","pinyin":"chéng","lectures":["chéng"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["口","王"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L7-0455","L7-0618"],"chemin":{"hsk":949,"lire":942},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"présenter ; prendre une forme","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"présenter, soumettre"},{"categorie":"V","fr":"prendre, présenter : forme, couleur"}]},"exemples":[],"origine":null},"城":{"c":"城","pinyin":"chéng","lectures":["chéng"],"niveau":3,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["土","丁","戈"],"sources":["surcharge"]},"mots":["L3-0076","L3-0096","L3-0097","L5-0108","L6-0127","L6-0128","L6-0129","L6-0712","L7-0462","L7-5429"],"chemin":{"hsk":354,"lire":130},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"ville ; rempart","acceptions":[{"categorie":"N","fr":"ville"},{"categorie":"N","fr":"rempart, muraille d'une ville"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"他住在城里。","pinyin":"Tā zhù zài chéng li.","fr":"Il habite en ville.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":{"statut":"relu","etiquette":"atteste","fr":"Le Shuowen jiezi explique 城 comme le rempart qui abrite la population, écrit avec 土, la terre, et 成, qui donne aussi le son chéng. Les murs des villes chinoises étaient faits de terre damée, d'où la présence de 土. Dans la décomposition actuelle, 成 se découpe en 丁 et 戈, mais c'est le groupe entier qui porte le son.","en":"The Shuowen jiezi explains 城 as the rampart that shelters the people, written with 土, earth, and 成, which also gives the sound chéng. The walls of Chinese towns were built of rammed earth, hence the 土. Today 成 is split into 丁 and 戈, but the sound comes from the whole group.","roles":{"土":"sens","丁":"son","戈":"son"}}},"惩":{"c":"惩","pinyin":"chéng","lectures":["chéng"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["彳","正","心"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L7-0465","L7-0466"],"chemin":{"hsk":949,"lire":942},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"punir","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"punir, châtier"}]},"exemples":[],"origine":null},"成":{"c":"成","pinyin":"chéng","lectures":["chéng"],"niveau":2,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["万","戈"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L2-0026","L2-0063","L2-0064","L2-0065","L2-0558","L2-0760","L3-0089","L3-0090","L3-0091","L3-0092","L3-0093","L3-0094","L3-0095","L3-0344","L3-0804","L3-0878","L4-0087","L4-0280","L4-0856","L4-0925","L5-0103","L5-0104","L5-0105","L5-0106","L5-0150","L5-0237","L5-0318","L5-0428","L5-0673","L5-1018","L6-0067","L6-0123","L6-0124","L6-0125","L6-0200","L7-0446","L7-0447","L7-0448","L7-0449","L7-0450","L7-0451","L7-0452","L7-0453","L7-0454","L7-0539","L7-0654","L7-1760","L7-2975","L7-3877","L7-4310","L7-4495","L7-4519","L7-4611","L7-4666","L7-4889","L7-4918","L7-5158","L7-5429"],"chemin":{"hsk":229,"lire":238},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"devenir ; réussir ; dixième","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"devenir, se transformer en ; réussir"},{"categorie":"M","fr":"dixième, dix pour cent"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"他成了我的好朋友。","pinyin":"Tā chéng le wǒ de hǎo péngyou.","fr":"Il est devenu un bon ami.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":{"statut":"relu","etiquette":"atteste","fr":"Le Shuowen jiezi glose 成 par « achever » et l'écrit avec 戊, une arme, et 丁 pour le son. On reconnaît toujours à droite 戈, la hallebarde. Achever une tâche, c'est réussir, et devenir ce qu'on devait être.","en":"The Shuowen jiezi glosses 成 as “to complete” and writes it with 戊, a weapon, and 丁 for the sound. You can still spot 戈, the halberd, on the right. Completing a task is succeeding, and becoming what one was meant to be.","roles":{"万":"forme","戈":"forme"}}},"承":{"c":"承","pinyin":"chéng","lectures":["chéng"],"niveau":4,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":[],"sources":[]},"mots":["L4-0090","L4-0091","L4-0092","L5-0107","L5-0364","L6-0126","L7-0229","L7-0460","L7-0461","L7-0585"],"chemin":{"hsk":488,"lire":481},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"porter, supporter ; se charger de","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"porter, supporter ; se charger de"}]},"exemples":[],"