sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"faire étalage de","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"faire étalage de ; donner libre cours à"}]},"exemples":[],"origine":null},"秤":{"c":"秤","pinyin":"chèng","lectures":["chèng"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["禾","平"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L7-0471"],"chemin":{"hsk":951,"lire":944},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"balance, romaine","acceptions":[{"categorie":"N","fr":"balance, romaine"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"用秤称一下这些苹果。","pinyin":"Yòng chèng chēng yīxià zhèxiē píngguǒ.","fr":"Pèse ces pommes.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"吃":{"c":"吃","pinyin":"chī","lectures":["chī"],"niveau":1,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["口","𠂉","乙"],"sources":["cjk-decomp","surcharge"]},"mots":["L1-0046","L1-0047","L1-0139","L4-0094","L4-0808","L5-0113","L7-0472","L7-0473","L7-0474","L7-0475","L7-0693","L7-2424"],"chemin":{"hsk":192,"lire":163},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"manger","acceptions":[]},"exemples":[{"zh":"我不吃肉。","pinyin":"Wǒ bù chī ròu.","fr":"Je ne mange pas de viande.","statut":"relu"},{"zh":"你想吃什么？","pinyin":"Nǐ xiǎng chī shénme?","fr":"Qu'est-ce que tu veux manger ?","statut":"relu"}],"origine":{"statut":"relu","etiquette":"atteste","fr":"Le Shuowen jiezi analyse 吃 par 口, la bouche, pour le sens, et l'élément qui s'écrit aujourd'hui 乞 pour le son, et lui donne le sens de bégayer, qu'il garde dans 口吃. Le sens de manger appartenait à un autre caractère, 喫, que 吃 a remplacé dans l'usage. À droite, 𠂉 et le trait 乙 forment 乞 qǐ, dont le son s'est éloigné de chī.","en":"The Shuowen jiezi analyses 吃 as 口, the mouth, for the meaning, plus the element now written 乞 for the sound, and gives it the sense of stammering, which survives in 口吃. The sense of eating belonged to another character, 喫, which 吃 replaced in use. On the right, 𠂉 and the stroke 乙 make up 乞 qǐ, whose sound has drifted away from chī.","roles":{"口":"sens","𠂉":"forme","乙":"forme"}}},"痴":{"c":"痴","pinyin":"chī","lectures":["c